<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Lityan shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Lityan shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Lityan Holdings Bhd was suspended on Monday at the request of the company pending an announcement, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said.</p>
<p>Shares of Lityan, an information technology company, were up 60 cents at 23.50 ringgit at midday.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
